%% Engineering Platform M0 —— 时序图集合（与 docs/00-M0-实施设计.md §5.2–5.4 一致）
%% 三张图：A 启动与握手 / B read_overview 全链路 / C 断线结果不明与只读对账
%% 若渲染器不支持单文件多图，请分别复制 A、B、C 段单独渲染。

%% ===================== A. MCP 启动与握手 =====================
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant WB as WorkBuddy
  participant MCP as EngineeringMcp (Python)
  participant IR as InstanceRegistry
  participant PC as PipeClient
  participant PS as PipeServer (Host)
  participant SR as SessionRegistry

  WB->>MCP: spawn(stdio) + initialize {protocolVersion:"2025-06-18"}
  MCP->>MCP: 协商协议版本 / 建 SQLite / 建日志
  MCP-->>WB: result {protocolVersion, capabilities:{tools}, serverInfo, instructions}
  WB->>MCP: notifications/initialized
  WB->>MCP: tools/list
  MCP->>MCP: ToolCatalog.list_tools()（不触达宿主）
  MCP-->>WB: result {tools:[sys_*, read_*, task_*]}
  WB->>MCP: tools/call {name:"sys_health", arguments:{}}
  MCP->>IR: list_instances()
  IR->>IR: 扫描 %LOCALAPPDATA%\EngineeringPlatform\instances\*.json
  IR-->>MCP: [InstanceInfo{pipeName,pid,startedAtUtc,...}]
  MCP->>PC: connect(pipeName)
  PC->>PS: WaitNamedPipeW + CreateFileW
  PS-->>PC: connected
  PC->>PS: hello {protocolVersion:"1.0", clientInfo, clientNonce}
  PS->>SR: 版本兼容判定 + IssueToken()
  SR-->>PS: sessionToken
  PS-->>PC: hello_ack {hostInstanceId, sessionToken, capabilities, gaps[], writeEnabled:false}
  PC-->>MCP: HandshakeInfo
  MCP->>PC: call("sys_health")
  PC->>PS: 请求帧 {tool:"sys_health", opId, sessionToken, ...}
  PS->>PS: 主线程 probe + health checks
  PS-->>PC: 响应帧 {ok:true, result:{checks:[...]}}
  PC-->>MCP: dict
  MCP->>MCP: audit + store.record_task()
  MCP-->>WB: content[0]=摘要, content[1]=resultRef JSON

%% ===================== B. read_overview 全链路 =====================
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant WB as WorkBuddy
  participant MCP as EngineeringMcp
  participant PC as PipeClient
  participant RT as HostRuntime
  participant MD as MainThreadDispatcher
  participant PR as HostStateProbe
  participant TH as ReadToolHandlers
  participant SC as SemanticCache
  participant EX as SemanticExtractor
  participant FP as DrawingFingerprint
  participant ST as Store

  WB->>MCP: tools/call read_overview {}
  MCP->>MCP: ToolCatalog.validate("read_overview", {}) → ok
  MCP->>PC: call("read_overview", {}, timeout_ms=15000)
  PC->>RT: 帧 {opId, tool, paramsDigest, sessionToken}
  RT->>RT: 封套校验 / 令牌校验 / 入队 WorkItem(deadline)
  RT->>MD: Submit(workItem, waitMs=2000)
  MD->>MD: Application.Idle 触发，出队
  MD->>PR: Probe(MdiActiveDocument)
  PR-->>MD: GateResult{ok:true, doc}
  MD->>TH: Handle("read_overview", params, ctx)
  TH->>FP: Compute(db, doc)
  FP-->>TH: "fp1:8c11a0d3…"
  TH->>SC: Get(fingerprint)
  alt 缓存命中（<5 s）
    SC-->>TH: SemanticModel
  else 未命中
    SC-->>TH: null
    TH->>EX: Extract(doc, limit=50000)
    EX->>EX: StartOpenCloseTransaction 遍历模型/图纸空间
    EX->>EX: Recognize(layer-map / block-map / 几何规则) + ScanAnomalies
    EX-->>TH: SemanticModel
    TH->>SC: Put(fingerprint, model)
  end
  TH->>TH: 组装 OverviewResult（裁剪至 maxResultBytes=350 KB）
  TH-->>MD: {ok:true, status:"verified", result}
  MD-->>RT: WorkItem.Result
  RT->>RT: 组装响应帧 → PipeConnection.WriteFrame
  RT-->>PC: 响应帧 {ok:true, result:{summary, counts, ...}}
  PC-->>MCP: dict
  MCP->>MCP: Budget.truncate(result)
  MCP->>ST: record_task + record_audit
  MCP-->>WB: content[0] 摘要文本 / content[1] resultRef / structuredContent

%% ===================== C. 断线 → 结果不明 → 只读对账 =====================
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant MCP as EngineeringMcp
  participant HB as HeartbeatTimer
  participant PC as PipeClient
  participant PS as PipeServer
  participant RC as Reconcile
  participant ST as Store

  MCP->>PC: call("read_query", {layer:"E-沟*"}) → opId=op-77
  PC->>PS: 请求帧 op-77
  Note over PS: CAD 进程被强杀 / 管道异常关闭
  PS--xPC: 连接断开（ReadFile 返回 ERROR_BROKEN_PIPE）
  PC->>PC: 关闭句柄，标记 pending 全部失败
  PC-->>MCP: PipeClosed(op-77)
  MCP->>ST: tasks.op-77.status = "unknown"（不自动重放）
  HB->>PC: 5 s 心跳 ×3 无响应
  HB->>MCP: 连接死亡事件
  MCP->>MCP: 下次 tools/call 前重新 instances.list() + hello
  MCP->>PC: 重连并 hello（新 sessionToken）
  MCP->>PC: call("task_reconcile", {opId:"op-77"})
  alt 宿主重启后内存任务表已无此 opId
    PC-->>RC: {decision:"unknown", evidence:{reason:"host_restarted"}}
    RC->>ST: tasks.op-77.decision = "unknown"
    RC-->>MCP: 只读请求未完成，可安全重试（必须用新 opId）
  else 宿主仍存活且能查到此 opId
    PC-->>RC: {decision:"verified", evidence:{elapsedMs:183}}
    RC->>ST: tasks.op-77.status="verified" + 补录结果摘要
    RC-->>MCP: 结果有效，可直接采用
  end
